  "term": "ANP",
  "definition": "ANP stands for atrial natriuretic peptide, a biological signaling molecule discussed here as a possible inhibitor of motion sickness. In this source, it appears to counter aldosterone-related changes in the inner ear, including endolymph expansion and related ion-transport activity.",
